{
    "title": "Legend of Mushroom",
    "description": "<b><font color=\"red\">\r\nThe new space-themed event starts on October 4th! The mushroom world ushers in the age of space for an all-new story. Costume \"Space Samurai\", mount \"Cheetah Zero\", and a new back accessory will also be available with new games!\r\n</font></b>\r\n\r\nJoin events like Disc Shooting, Extreme Race, and more to earn exclusive rewards!\r\nOver 30 million downloads worldwide! Legend of Mushroom is officially launched now! Start an unexpected RPG adventure with the little mushrooms! \r\n\r\nBig adventure of a little mushroom! Role-playing with infinite levels!\r\n\r\nOne day, a lamp appeared amidst the chaos, shining on mushrooms and turning them into brave warriors. Since then, mushrooms have been embarking on adventures in search of more lamps and greater powers.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Cute Mushroom Characters!\r\nA small mushroom embarks on a special adventure to become human!\r\n\u25a0 Equipment Galore\r\nNo more farming in battles. Just tap the Genie to get all kinds of equipment!\r\n\u25a0 Choose Your Class!\r\nEven a small mushroom can choose different Classes and become an elite adventurer!\r\n\u25a0 Unique Designs\r\nAll kinds of creative mushroom designs! Customize your own mushroom!\r\n\u25a0 Boss Challenge\r\nJoin an alliance. Even small mushrooms can defeat evil dragons!\r\n\u25a0 Strongest Alliance\r\nFight alongside friends and compete with other alliances!\r\n\u25a0 Build Your Own Garden!\r\nProtect your garden, mine for minerals, and catch thieves!\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media:\r\nfacebook.com/legendofmushroom\r\n https://discord.gg/lom",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><font color=\"red\"><br>The new space-themed event starts on October 4th! The mushroom world ushers in the age of space for an all-new story. Costume &quot;Space Samurai&quot;, mount &quot;Cheetah Zero&quot;, and a new back accessory will also be available with new games!<br></font></b><br><br>Join events like Disc Shooting, Extreme Race, and more to earn exclusive rewards!<br>Over 30 million downloads worldwide! Legend of Mushroom is officially launched now! Start an unexpected RPG adventure with the little mushrooms! <br><br>Big adventure of a little mushroom! Role-playing with infinite levels!<br><br>One day, a lamp appeared amidst the chaos, shining on mushrooms and turning them into brave warriors. Since then, mushrooms have been embarking on adventures in search of more lamps and greater powers.<br><br>\u25a0 Cute Mushroom Characters!<br>A small mushroom embarks on a special adventure to become human!<br>\u25a0 Equipment Galore<br>No more farming in battles. Just tap the Genie to get all kinds of equipment!<br>\u25a0 Choose Your Class!<br>Even a small mushroom can choose different Classes and become an elite adventurer!<br>\u25a0 Unique Designs<br>All kinds of creative mushroom designs! Customize your own mushroom!<br>\u25a0 Boss Challenge<br>Join an alliance. Even small mushrooms can defeat evil dragons!<br>\u25a0 Strongest Alliance<br>Fight alongside friends and compete with other alliances!<br>\u25a0 Build Your Own Garden!<br>Protect your garden, mine for minerals, and catch thieves!<br><br>Follow us on social media:<br>facebook.com/legendofmushroom<br> https://discord.gg/lom",
